{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2aa79dc6-88b8-8f1e-a192-effd1ccbeca6",
  "created_at": "2025-12-22T14:02:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Priya Cohen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:59:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:59:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. This is Priya Cohen. I'm calling about trash pickup, and I'm a little irritated, I'll be honest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:59:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Ms. Cohen, tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:59:44-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at 470 Annandale Road, up in the North End. I run a small business out of the building, and nobody has told me what the pickup schedule is for this week. Christmas is Thursday, New Year's is the week after. I got no notice, nothing in the mail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:00:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, holiday weeks can shift things. Let me pull up your route. Annandale Road, you said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:00:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four seventy. And it's Annandale, not Annadale. People always drop the second n."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:00:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, thank you. Two n's. Okay, so normally what's your pickup day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:00:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday. Which is Christmas. So obviously that's not happening, I assume. But what is happening? That's what I'm asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:00:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the usual way it goes. When the holiday lands on your day, collection typically slides to the next day, so Friday. And then the same thing the following week for New Year's."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:00:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Typically. I don't want typically. I want to know the schedule. Is it Friday the twenty-sixth, and then what, Friday the second?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:00:42-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at what I have in front of me. [pause] Okay, I can see the notice is on the system for the holiday week, Friday for the Christmas week. For the New Year's week I'm not seeing a separate line yet, so I don't want to tell you wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:00:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's not even posted. It's the twenty-second of December. You'd think somebody would have it posted by now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:01:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. It should be up soon, but I can't give you a date on that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:01:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm-hm. And recycling? Is that the same shift, or does it go its own way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:01:18-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recycling follows the same shift as your trash day on that route, so it moves with it. Just bring it out the night before to be safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:01:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I'd like a supervisor to call me back about this, though. Somebody who can tell me the post-holiday schedule for certain, and why it isn't sent out ahead of time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:01:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can put in that request. Best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:01:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0154. That's my cell, so if I don't pick up, leave a message. I'm in and out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:01:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one five four. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:01:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. You read it back well, I'll give you that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:01:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I'll note it's about the holiday and New Year's pickup schedule for 470 Annandale. They're pretty busy this week, so it may be tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:02:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow's fine. Just not after Christmas, please, because then it's useless to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:02:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, I'll flag that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:02:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly, it's not even three o'clock and I'm already turning the lights on in the office. These dark afternoons go on forever this time of year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:02:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do. It's dark by four-thirty now. At least the solstice was yesterday, so it starts getting better."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:02:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it was today or yesterday, depending on who you ask. But yes, small mercies. Alright, thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:02:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Cohen. Have a good week, and happy holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T14:02:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
